# SAM rules expanded from sim/configs/*.yml, one line per rule, in order:
#   <config> <space> <base> <size> <dst_id> <port>
# The meeting point of the two readers that must expand a config identically --
# sim/tools/address_map.py (generate time) and nmu/sam_yaml.hpp (simulation
# runtime, via +sam_config). test_sam_config_parity.py holds the first to this
# file and ref_model/c_model/tests/nmu/test_sam_config.cpp the second.
# Generated by test_sam_config_parity.write_golden(); a changed line is a
# changed address map.
